OL,3,GNEWSA'People are realising girls can
OL,4,Aactually ride bikes'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British motocross champion from
OL,7,FDoncaster has set up one of the first
OL,8,Fall-girl motocross training academies
OL,9,Fto teach the next generation of female
OL,10,Fracers.
OL,12,FWhen Lauren Collingwood took up the
OL,13,Fsport as a child, she estimates she was
OL,14,Fone of very few females competing in a
OL,15,F"male-dominated" field.
OL,17,FThe WMX British & World motocross racer
OL,18,Fcreated Girls That Moto to pass along
OL,19,Fher knowledge and expertise from more
OL,20,Fthan 20 years on the track.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
