OL,3,GNEWSA'People are realising girls can
OL,4,Aactually ride bikes'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's not really a really well-known
OL,7,Fsport, especially for girls and women
OL,8,F[but] people are getting to know more
OL,9,Fabout it and they're realising that
OL,10,Fgirls can actually ride bikes," she
OL,11,Fsaid.
